{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don't Lose Hope begins with a man who was fired from his job and whose life was ruined, starting his dream job as a baker with his wife.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shopping System</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy ingredients such as flour, salt, yeast from the computer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knead dough using ingredients, produce bread and sell at the market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your ingredient stock by earning income from each sale.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Development System</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with a small market stall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the chance to buy bigger stalls, more products and your own oven by managing your income correctly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance on the path to becoming the biggest baker in the city!</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603560?t=1746484795","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603560?t=1746484795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603560/0fd7dd615a7729f38ff0ffa793156c047a6b11a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746484795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603560/0fd7dd615a7729f38ff0ffa793156c047a6b11a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746484795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don't Lose Hope begins with a man who was fired from his job and whose life was ruined, starting his dream job as a baker with his wife.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shopping System</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy ingredients s